r education team ([https://wwnorton.com/college](https://wwnorton.com/college)) can provide instructor desk copies and digital access specifically for syllabus review purposes\n\n---\n\nWould you like help comparing Alberts' general approach to signal transduction against Lodish or another reference based on what I *can* reliably confirm from available sources?",
